OL,3,GNEWSASuccess for BBC at Royal
OL,4,ATelevision Society NI awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has won ten awards at the Royal
OL,7,FTelevision Society NI Awards in Belfast
OL,8,Fon Thursday night.
OL,10,FBBC Newsline won the News Coverage
OL,11,Fcategory for its reporting on the Race
OL,12,FRiots in June 2026.
OL,14,FSpotlight's Politican, Predator &
OL,15,FPaedophile programme about former DUP
OL,16,Fleader Jeffrey Donaldson in the wake of
OL,17,Fhis conviction for a series of child
OL,18,Fsex offences, including rape, won the
OL,19,FBest Current Affairs award for BBC
OL,20,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
