OL,3,GNEWSASuccess for BBC at Royal
OL,4,ATelevision Society NI awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC NI head of news, Damien Magee,
OL,7,Fsaid: "News matters and we work hard to
OL,8,Fgive audiences a service they can
OL,9,Ftrust, that keeps them informed,
OL,10,Fexplains what's happening and makes
OL,11,Ftheir voices heard."
